<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

	<!-- EN: pressurised hot water pipe -->
	<STB_HotWaterPipe.label>高压热水管</STB_HotWaterPipe.label>

	<!-- EN: Lagged, pressure-rated pipe that carries superheated water from trash gasifiers to a steam turbine. Can be placed under walls and other buildings. -->
	<STB_HotWaterPipe.description>带保温层的耐压管道，把垃圾气化炉的过热水输送到蒸汽涡轮机。可以铺设在墙和其他建筑下方。</STB_HotWaterPipe.description>

	<!-- EN: hidden pressurised hot water pipe -->
	<STB_HotWaterPipeHidden.label>隐藏高压热水管</STB_HotWaterPipeHidden.label>

	<!-- EN: Pressurised hot water pipe buried out of sight. Can be placed under walls and other buildings. -->
	<STB_HotWaterPipeHidden.description>埋在看不见之处的高压热水管。可以铺设在墙和其他建筑下方。</STB_HotWaterPipeHidden.description>

	<!-- EN: pressurised hot water valve -->
	<STB_HotWaterValve.label>高压热水阀</STB_HotWaterValve.label>

	<!-- EN: Opens or closes a pressurised hot water line, to split stoves between turbines or cut a turbine off. -->
	<STB_HotWaterValve.description>打开或关闭一条高压热水管路，用于在涡轮机之间分配炉子，或切断某台涡轮机。</STB_HotWaterValve.description>

	<!-- EN: cobbled steam turbine -->
	<STB_CobbledTurbine.label>拼凑蒸汽涡轮机</STB_CobbledTurbine.label>

	<!-- EN: A steam turbine pieced together from scrap plate and a salvaged generator, driven by pressurised hot water from trash gasifiers. It takes up to 4800W of heat. Three gears: low turns over on 500W at 50%, medium needs 1500W for 60%, high needs 3000W for 70%. Below its gear's minimum it stalls, wasting the heat. It rattles, and breaks down often. With a turbine on the network, the burners' own Stirling engines stand down. Connect it with a pressurised hot water pipe under it. -->
	<STB_CobbledTurbine.description>用废钢板和一台回收的发电机拼凑而成的蒸汽涡轮机，由垃圾气化炉的高压热水驱动。最多接收 4800W 热量。三个档位：低档 500W 起转、效率 50%，中档需要 1500W、效率 60%，高档需要 3000W、效率 70%。低于档位最低值时会失速，浪费热量。它会咔哒作响，而且经常故障。网络上有涡轮机时，燃烧炉自带的斯特林发动机会停止工作。在它下方铺设高压热水管来连接。</STB_CobbledTurbine.description>

	<!-- EN: steam turbine -->
	<STB_SteamTurbine.label>蒸汽涡轮机</STB_SteamTurbine.label>

	<!-- EN: A compact steam turbine and generator, driven by pressurised hot water from trash gasifiers. It takes up to 6000W of heat - three gasifiers on high. Three gears: low turns over on 500W at 60%, medium needs 1500W for 70%, high needs 3000W for 80%. Below its gear's minimum it stalls, wasting the heat. With a turbine on the network, the burners' own Stirling engines stand down. Connect it with a pressurised hot water pipe under it. -->
	<STB_SteamTurbine.description>紧凑的蒸汽涡轮发电机组，由垃圾气化炉的高压热水驱动。最多接收 6000W 热量——三台高功率气化炉。三个档位：低档 500W 起转、效率 60%，中档需要 1500W、效率 70%，高档需要 3000W、效率 80%。低于档位最低值时会失速，浪费热量。网络上有涡轮机时，燃烧炉自带的斯特林发动机会停止工作。在它下方铺设高压热水管来连接。</STB_SteamTurbine.description>

	<!-- EN: hot water radiator -->
	<STB_HotWaterRadiator.label>热水暖气片</STB_HotWaterRadiator.label>

	<!-- EN: A cast radiator that heats its room with pressurised hot water from trash gasifiers, up to the temperature you set. Radiators get the heat the steam turbines on their network leave over, then draw on the Overpressure Tank. Connect it by running a pressurised hot water pipe under it. -->
	<STB_HotWaterRadiator.description>铸造暖气片，用垃圾气化炉的高压热水为房间供暖，直到你设定的温度。暖气片获得网络上蒸汽涡轮机用剩的热量，然后从超压罐取热。在它下方铺设高压热水管来连接。</STB_HotWaterRadiator.description>

	<!-- EN: cobbled radiator -->
	<STB_CobbledRadiator.label>拼凑暖气片</STB_CobbledRadiator.label>

	<!-- EN: A radiator knocked together from three lengths of salvaged pipe, lashed with wire and propped on timber. It heats its room with pressurised hot water from trash gasifiers, up to the temperature you set - just not much, and its joints weep steam more often than a proper radiator's. Radiators get the heat the steam turbines on their network leave over, then draw on the Overpressure Tank. Connect it by running a pressurised hot water pipe under it. -->
	<STB_CobbledRadiator.description>用三段回收管道拼成的暖气片，用铁丝捆着，垫在木头上。它用垃圾气化炉的高压热水为房间供暖，直到你设定的温度——只是供热不多，接头也比正规暖气片更常渗出蒸汽。暖气片获得网络上蒸汽涡轮机用剩的热量，然后从超压罐取热。在它下方铺设高压热水管来连接。</STB_CobbledRadiator.description>

	<!-- EN: overpressure tank -->
	<STB_HeatAccumulator.label>超压罐</STB_HeatAccumulator.label>

	<!-- EN: An insulated tank that takes the heat the turbines and radiators don't use, so the burners don't build pressure. It feeds radiators from what it holds, and tops a stalling turbine up to its gear's minimum when the burners fall short - through a breakdown or a refuel. With Dubs Bad Hygiene it also feeds the plumbing's hot water tanks and radiators. The fuller it is, the likelier it is to explode: have a colonist bleed it now and then, or set it to auto-release above a level, which vents the heat into its room. -->
	<STB_HeatAccumulator.description>保温储罐，接收涡轮机和暖气片用不完的热量，使燃烧炉不会积聚压力。它用储存的热量为暖气片供热，并在燃烧炉供热不足时——因故障或加燃料——为失速的涡轮机补足到档位最低值。安装 Dubs Bad Hygiene 时，它还会为管道系统的热水箱和暖气片供热。储量越满越容易爆炸：时常让殖民者给它泄压，或设置超过某个水平时自动泄放，把热量排进它所在的房间。</STB_HeatAccumulator.description>

	<!-- EN: wall steam vent -->
	<STB_SteamVent.label>壁挂蒸汽排放口</STB_SteamVent.label>

	<!-- EN: A louvred steam vent hung on a wall. It blows off the heat nobody else on its pressurised hot water network wants - after the turbines, radiators and Overpressure Tanks - so the burners don't build pressure, and it can drain the tanks above a level you set. Up to 3000W comes out as scalding steam on the side of the wall it hangs on: hang it outside. Inside, it heats the room fast, and anyone standing under it gets burned. Its valve shuts it. Run a pressurised hot water pipe to the cell it hangs over - pipe can go under the wall. -->
	<STB_SteamVent.description>挂在墙上的百叶蒸汽排放口。它排掉高压热水网络上没有其他设备需要的热量——在涡轮机、暖气片和超压罐之后——使燃烧炉不积聚压力，还可以把储罐排放到你设定的水平以下。最多 3000W 会以滚烫蒸汽的形式从它所挂的那一侧喷出：请挂在外侧。挂在室内时，它会迅速加热房间，站在它下面的人会被烫伤。它的阀门可以关闭它。把高压热水管铺到它所挂的格子——管道可以从墙下穿过。</STB_SteamVent.description>

	<!-- EN: steam vent -->
	<STB_SteamVentGround.label>蒸汽排放口</STB_SteamVentGround.label>

	<!-- EN: A standpipe steam vent: a pressurised hot water pipe turned up out of the ground under a louvred cap. It blows off the heat nobody else on its network wants - after the turbines, radiators and Overpressure Tanks - so the burners don't build pressure, and it can drain the tanks above a level you set. Up to 3000W comes out as scalding steam around it: build it outside. Indoors, it heats the room fast, and anyone passing through gets burned. Its valve shuts it. Run a pressurised hot water pipe under it. -->
	<STB_SteamVentGround.description>立管式蒸汽排放口：一根从地下伸出的高压热水管，顶上盖着百叶帽。它排掉网络上没有其他设备需要的热量——在涡轮机、暖气片和超压罐之后——使燃烧炉不积聚压力，还可以把储罐排放到你设定的水平以下。最多 3000W 会以滚烫蒸汽的形式向周围喷出：请建在室外。在室内时，它会迅速加热房间，路过的人会被烫伤。它的阀门可以关闭它。在它下方铺设高压热水管。</STB_SteamVentGround.description>

	<!-- EN: cobbled trash gasifier -->
	<STB_TrashbrickPelletStove.label>拼凑垃圾气化炉</STB_TrashbrickPelletStove.label>

	<!-- EN: A trash gasifier cobbled together from scrap plate and a salvaged Stirling engine, burning compressed trashbricks. It has three modes: eco gets the most heat from each brick, high the most heat. With no steam turbine on its pressurised hot water network, its Stirling engine makes a little power (75-300W) from three times that in heat; the rest of its heat goes out on the pipe, so it still needs an Overpressure Tank or radiators, or its pressure builds - and with no safety valve, it bursts. It breaks down often. Refill it by hand, or put a hopper on its intake - the green-marked port on the side it faces - and it will draw fuel from that. It heats the room while it runs. Its exhaust must be piped to an exhaust port, or it fills the room around it with toxic gas. -->
	<STB_TrashbrickPelletStove.description>用废钢板和一台回收的斯特林发动机拼凑而成的垃圾气化炉，燃烧压缩垃圾砖。它有三种模式：节能模式每块砖产热最多，高功率模式总产热最多。高压热水网络上没有蒸汽涡轮机时，它的斯特林发动机会用三倍的热量产生少量电力（75-300W）；其余热量经管道送出，所以它仍然需要超压罐或暖气片，否则压力会积聚——而它没有安全阀，会爆裂。它经常故障。可以手动加料，或在进料口——它朝向那一侧的绿色标记接口——放一个料斗，它会从中取燃料。运转时会加热房间。它的废气必须用管道接到排气口，否则会让周围的房间充满毒气。</STB_TrashbrickPelletStove.description>

	<!-- EN: Trashbricks -->
	<STB_TrashbrickPelletStove.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>燃料</STB_TrashbrickPelletStove.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>

	<!-- EN: trash gasifier -->
	<STB_TrashbrickGasifier.label>垃圾气化炉</STB_TrashbrickGasifier.label>

	<!-- EN: A sealed trash gasifier that bakes trashbricks into syngas and burns it cleanly: 1500W of heat on 75 bricks a day in normal mode, 750W on 30 in eco, 2000W on 112 in high. With no steam turbine on its pressurised hot water network, its Stirling engine makes some power (100-500W) from three times that in heat; the rest goes out on the pipe to an Overpressure Tank or radiators. A safety valve vents any pressure left over. Its catalytic filters cut the ground pollution to a third of a cobbled burner's, though the exhaust still needs piping away. The housing is insulated, so it leaks only a little heat. Refill it by hand, or put a hopper on its intake - the green-marked port on the side it faces - and it will draw fuel from that. -->
	<STB_TrashbrickGasifier.description>密封式垃圾气化炉，把垃圾砖烘烤成合成气并清洁燃烧：普通模式每天 75 块砖产 1500W 热量，节能模式每天 30 块产 750W，高功率模式每天 112 块产 2000W。高压热水网络上没有蒸汽涡轮机时，它的斯特林发动机会用三倍的热量产生一些电力（100-500W）；其余热量经管道送往超压罐或暖气片。安全阀会排掉多余的压力。它的催化过滤器把地面污染降到拼凑燃烧炉的三分之一，但废气仍需用管道排走。外壳带保温层，只散失少量热量。可以手动加料，或在进料口——它朝向那一侧的绿色标记接口——放一个料斗，它会从中取燃料。</STB_TrashbrickGasifier.description>

	<!-- EN: Trashbricks -->
	<STB_TrashbrickGasifier.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>燃料</STB_TrashbrickGasifier.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>

	<!-- EN: large cobbled trash gasifier -->
	<STB_LargeCobbledStove.label>大型拼凑垃圾气化炉</STB_LargeCobbledStove.label>

	<!-- EN: A long firebox welded together from whatever plate was lying around, a scrapped boiler drum, two mismatched flues and a salvaged generator, all on compressed trashbricks. Three times the heat of a cobbled trash gasifier from a little less fuel per watt, and just as short of a safety valve. It has no engine of its own: pipe it to a steam turbine. Refill it by hand, or put a hopper on its intake - the green-marked port on the side it faces - and it will draw fuel from that. It heats the room while it runs. Its exhaust must be piped to an exhaust port, or it fills the room around it with toxic gas. -->
	<STB_LargeCobbledStove.description>一个用手边各种钢板、一个报废锅炉筒、两根不配套的烟道和一台回收发电机焊成的长炉膛，燃烧压缩垃圾砖。产热是拼凑垃圾气化炉的三倍，每瓦耗料略少，同样没有安全阀。它没有自带发动机：请用管道连到蒸汽涡轮机。可以手动加料，或在进料口——它朝向那一侧的绿色标记接口——放一个料斗，它会从中取燃料。运转时会加热房间。它的废气必须用管道接到排气口，否则会让周围的房间充满毒气。</STB_LargeCobbledStove.description>

	<!-- EN: Trashbricks -->
	<STB_LargeCobbledStove.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>燃料</STB_LargeCobbledStove.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>

	<!-- EN: large trash gasifier -->
	<STB_LargeGasifier.label>大型垃圾气化炉</STB_LargeGasifier.label>

	<!-- EN: A bigger sealed gasifier: one large chamber, a longer filter bank and its own generator. Three times the heat of a trash gasifier from a little less fuel per watt - at full burn, enough to run one steam turbine flat out. Like the small one it bakes trashbricks into syngas and burns it cleanly, but it has no engine of its own: pipe it to a steam turbine. Its catalytic filters cut the ground pollution to a third of a cobbled burner's, though the exhaust still needs piping away. The housing is insulated, so it leaks only a little heat. Refill it by hand, or put a hopper on its intake - the green-marked port on the side it faces - and it will draw fuel from that. -->
	<STB_LargeGasifier.description>更大的密封气化炉：一个大炉室、更长的过滤器组和自带的发电机。产热是垃圾气化炉的三倍，每瓦耗料略少——全功率时足以让一台蒸汽涡轮机满负荷运转。和小型号一样，它把垃圾砖烘烤成合成气并清洁燃烧，但没有自带发动机：请用管道连到蒸汽涡轮机。它的催化过滤器把地面污染降到拼凑燃烧炉的三分之一，但废气仍需用管道排走。外壳带保温层，只散失少量热量。可以手动加料，或在进料口——它朝向那一侧的绿色标记接口——放一个料斗，它会从中取燃料。</STB_LargeGasifier.description>

	<!-- EN: Trashbricks -->
	<STB_LargeGasifier.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>燃料</STB_LargeGasifier.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>

	<!-- EN: industrial trash gasifier -->
	<STB_IndustrialGasifier.label>工业垃圾气化炉</STB_IndustrialGasifier.label>

	<!-- EN: A plant-scale gasifier: two chambers in series, a double filter bank, twin exhaust stacks and a full-size generator on one long skid. Six times the heat of a trash gasifier and the most out of every brick - a fifth less fuel per watt - at full burn, enough to run two steam turbines flat out. Like the small one it burns clean. It has no engine of its own: pipe it to steam turbines. Its catalytic filters cut the ground pollution to a third of a cobbled burner's, though the exhaust still needs piping away. The housing is insulated, so it leaks only a little heat. Refill it by hand, or put a hopper on its intake - the green-marked port on the side it faces - and it will draw fuel from that. -->
	<STB_IndustrialGasifier.description>厂级气化炉：串联的两个炉室、双过滤器组、两根排气烟囱和一台全尺寸发电机，都装在一条长底座上。产热是垃圾气化炉的六倍，每块砖利用率最高——每瓦耗料少五分之一——全功率时足以让两台蒸汽涡轮机满负荷运转。和小型号一样清洁燃烧。它没有自带发动机：请用管道连到蒸汽涡轮机。它的催化过滤器把地面污染降到拼凑燃烧炉的三分之一，但废气仍需用管道排走。外壳带保温层，只散失少量热量。可以手动加料，或在进料口——它朝向那一侧的绿色标记接口——放一个料斗，它会从中取燃料。</STB_IndustrialGasifier.description>

	<!-- EN: Trashbricks -->
	<STB_IndustrialGasifier.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>燃料</STB_IndustrialGasifier.comps.CompProperties_Refuelable.fuelLabel>

	<!-- EN: fuel hopper -->
	<STB_FuelHopper.label>燃料料斗</STB_FuelHopper.label>

	<!-- EN: A hopper for trashbrick fuel. Build it on a trash gasifier's intake - the green-marked port - with its spout toward the machine, and the machine pulls fuel from it as it burns. Haulers or a conveyor belt can fill it. It holds up to three stacks. -->
	<STB_FuelHopper.description>装垃圾砖燃料的料斗。把它建在垃圾气化炉的进料口——绿色标记的接口——出料口朝向机器，机器燃烧时就会从中取燃料。搬运工或传送带可以给它装料。最多容纳三堆。</STB_FuelHopper.description>

	<!-- EN: exhaust pipe -->
	<STB_ExhaustPipe.label>排气管</STB_ExhaustPipe.label>

	<!-- EN: Sooty flue pipe that carries exhaust from trash gasifiers to an exhaust port. Can be placed under walls and other buildings. -->
	<STB_ExhaustPipe.description>沾满煤烟的烟道管，把垃圾气化炉的废气输送到排气口。可以铺设在墙和其他建筑下方。</STB_ExhaustPipe.description>

	<!-- EN: hidden exhaust pipe -->
	<STB_ExhaustPipeHidden.label>隐藏排气管</STB_ExhaustPipeHidden.label>

	<!-- EN: Exhaust pipe buried out of sight. Can be placed under walls and other buildings. -->
	<STB_ExhaustPipeHidden.description>埋在看不见之处的排气管。可以铺设在墙和其他建筑下方。</STB_ExhaustPipeHidden.description>

	<!-- EN: exhaust port -->
	<STB_ExhaustPort.label>排气口</STB_ExhaustPort.label>

	<!-- EN: A soot-blackened stack where the exhaust network lets out the fumes of burning trash. The ground around it slowly fills with pollution. Build it outdoors: indoors, it fills the room with toxic gas instead. With several ports on one network, the exhaust is split between them. Its damper closes it. Its draught fan needs power (80W): unpowered, it can't draw the exhaust and the fumes back up and come out around the burners. Run an exhaust pipe under it to connect it. A garbage compactor on the same exhaust network sends its fumes here too. -->
	<STB_ExhaustPort.description>被熏黑的烟囱，废气网络在这里排出燃烧垃圾产生的烟气。周围的地面会慢慢被污染。请建在室外：建在室内会让房间充满毒气。一个网络上有多个排气口时，废气会在它们之间分配。它的风门可以关闭它。它的引风机需要电力（80W）：断电时无法抽出废气，烟气会倒流，从燃烧炉周围冒出。在它下方铺设排气管来连接。同一废气网络上的垃圾压缩机也会把废气送到这里。</STB_ExhaustPort.description>

	<!-- EN: wall exhaust port -->
	<STB_ExhaustPortWall.label>壁挂排气口</STB_ExhaustPortWall.label>

	<!-- EN: An exhaust duct hung on a wall. It blows the fumes of burning trash out on the side of the wall it's hung on: toxic gas, a little heat, and pollution slowly spreading over the ground below it. Hang it on the outside of a wall - on the inside it fills the room with toxic gas. With several ports on one network, the exhaust is split between them. Its damper closes it. Its draught fan needs power (80W): unpowered, it can't draw the exhaust and the fumes back up and come out around the burners. Run an exhaust pipe to the cell it hangs over - pipe can go under the wall. A garbage compactor on the same exhaust network sends its fumes here too. -->
	<STB_ExhaustPortWall.description>挂在墙上的排气管道口。它把燃烧垃圾的烟气从所挂的那一侧吹出：毒气、少量热量，以及慢慢扩散到下方地面的污染。请挂在墙的外侧——挂在内侧会让房间充满毒气。一个网络上有多个排气口时，废气会在它们之间分配。它的风门可以关闭它。它的引风机需要电力（80W）：断电时无法抽出废气，烟气会倒流，从燃烧炉周围冒出。把排气管铺到它所挂的格子——管道可以从墙下穿过。同一废气网络上的垃圾压缩机也会把废气送到这里。</STB_ExhaustPortWall.description>

	<!-- EN: exhaust expansion tank -->
	<STB_ExhaustTank.label>废气膨胀罐</STB_ExhaustTank.label>

	<!-- EN: A sealed tank on the exhaust network that holds the exhaust when no exhaust port can take it - a power cut that stops the ports' draught fans, or every damper shut. While it has room, the burners, garbage compactors and factory machines on the network fill it instead of backing their fumes up into their rooms. It holds about 30,000 toxic gas - roughly eight hours of a trash gasifier on normal - and once a port is working again it drains into the ports over about two hours. When it's full, the exhaust backs up as before. If it's destroyed or taken apart, everything inside comes out at once. Run an exhaust pipe under it to connect it. -->
	<STB_ExhaustTank.description>废气网络上的密封储罐，在没有排气口能接收废气时储存废气——比如停电导致排气口的引风机停转，或所有风门都关闭。只要还有空间，网络上的燃烧炉、垃圾压缩机和工厂机器就会把废气送进它，而不是倒流回自己的房间。它可储存约 30,000 毒气——大约是一台普通模式垃圾气化炉八小时的量——当有排气口恢复工作后，它会在约两小时内排入排气口。罐满时，废气会像以前一样倒流。如果它被摧毁或拆除，里面的所有废气会一次性释放。在它下方铺设排气管来连接。</STB_ExhaustTank.description>

